<ul class="bullet-list mb-3">
  <li><em>Check our beta</em> uses the same logbook as the regular version, and gets new features first. <a class="text-accent-ink underline" href="/help/beta-channel/" data-apex-link>Read more</a>.</li>
  <li><em>Check our beta</em> has its own address, <strong>beta.climbinglogbook.com</strong>. Logging in at climbinglogbook.com takes you there.</li>
  <li>If you've installed Climbing Logbook as a Progressive Web App (<a class="text-accent-ink underline" href="/help/install/" data-apex-link>PWA</a>), install <strong>Logbook Beta</strong> from that address too. It's a separate PWA, so you can keep both.</li>
  <li>The hardest moves you write when opted in to the <em>Check our beta</em> channel are saved without your name or account, to help us improve how we read them.</li>
</ul>
